p-ddc24da18ce9a5","name":"吴夫人（孙坚妻）","evidence":["feipin-q-92e2c19ee1a56b1b68f0","feipin-q-f59ad72a3fbd6b0cb0e5","feipin-q-ca90b14c29df5020487c","feipin-q-0dedf7b10f718f7fce32","feipin-q-f06a2a52451458ce7162","feipin-q-8962f93030107e4c42f9","feipin-q-2a7b9826a974ec87f18b","feipin-q-350eb23596228579b7de","feipin-q-00b77fef38eab4b34a66","wufan-q-44ded950143707992ec8"],"facts":[{"id":"feipin-f-52eddd0772955da3fab9","text":"籍贯迁居：吴人，徙钱唐","evidence":["feipin-q-2a7b9826a974ec87f18b"]},{"id":"feipin-f-56dcafc03e5816914e71","text":"弟：吴景","evidence":["feipin-q-350eb23596228579b7de"]},{"id":"feipin-f-c77a309170c8d335ab21","text":"子：孙权","evidence":["feipin-q-00b77fef38eab4b34a66"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"feipin-q-00b77fef38eab4b34a66","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-a09b3f1b43e1c3506aa8","layer":"original","quote":"孙破虏吴夫人，吴主权母也。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-0dedf7b10f718f7fce32","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-5b9484490fd5f60f79bb","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《搜神记》曰：“初，夫人孕而梦月入其怀，既而生策。及权在孕，又梦日入其怀。以告坚曰：‘昔妊策，梦月入我怀；今也又梦日入我怀，何也？’坚曰：‘日月者，阴阳之精，极贵之象；吾子孙其兴乎！’”","attribution":"裴注·搜神记","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4914ebe902f1bf0f42b3","start":0,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-2a7b9826a974ec87f18b","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-a09b3f1b43e1c3506aa8","layer":"original","quote":"本吴人，徙钱唐。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":13,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-350eb23596228579b7de","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-a09b3f1b43e1c3506aa8","layer":"original","quote":"早失父母，与弟景居。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-8962f93030107e4c42f9","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-fb54938cc6f918fd2a03","layer":"original","quote":"权母吴，为权聘以为妃，爱幸有宠。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":26,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-92e2c19ee1a56b1b68f0","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-913913df849dedebb73d","layer":"original","quote":"孙坚闻其才貌，欲娶之。吴氏亲戚嫌坚轻狡，将拒焉；坚甚以惭恨。夫人谓亲戚曰：“何爱一女以取祸乎？如有不遇〖1〗，命也！”于是遂许为婚，生四男一女。﹝一﹞","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-ca90b14c29df5020487c","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-c35a213429bae18c0442","layer":"original","quote":"建安（七）〔十二〕年，临薨，引见张昭等，属以后事。合葬高陵。﹝四﹞","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":6,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-f06a2a52451458ce7162","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-080517cf7c2fb59c8f80","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《会稽典录》曰：“策功曹魏（腾）〔滕〕，以迕意见谴，将杀之；士大夫忧恐，计无所出。夫人乃倚大井，而谓策曰：‘汝新造江南，其事未集；方当优贤礼士，舍过录功。魏功曹，在公尽规；汝今日杀之，则明日人皆叛汝。吾不忍见祸之及，当先投此井中耳！’策大惊，遽释（腾）〔滕〕。夫人智略权谲，类皆如此。”","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6a1592dc85eae5334353","start":0,"end":146,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"feipin-q-f59ad72a3fbd6b0cb0e5","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-a8d09f2727079b46d1d0","layer":"original","quote":"及权少年统业，夫人助治军国，甚有补益。﹝三﹞","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wufan-q-44ded950143707992ec8","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-10857288d302bde370ae","layer":"pei","quote":"初亦忤策，几殆，赖太妃救得免","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-12d93e9e230aa0662150","start":56,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
